B.LP=new A.N("loafstand","Sugarloaf Stand","pantry",1,"The stand where the household sugarloaf is kept: a cone of hard sugar as tall as a top hat, and about as heavy as a brick. The blue paper wrapper lies flat and empty, with the sugar nippers beside it. The loaf is gone.",B.Mx,B.ie,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.La=new A.N("planner","Appointment Book","study",0,"Mrs. Senclair's appointment book, kept under lock. Today's page: \u201c10 AM, Bourbon & Sons. Sign the sale: the company, the name, and every recipe. Staff to go at the month end. Tell them nothing.\u201d",B.cL,B.H,"desk",B.j,B.c,!1,null)
