B.LF=new A.N("loafdirt","Sugarloaf","backyard",0,"A spade's depth down in the loose earth: the sugarloaf. The point is cracked clean off, and there is custard in the crack. It wants dusting for fingerprints.",B.az,B.af,"dirt",B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.KY=new A.N("loafkennel","Sugarloaf","backyard",0,"Pushed to the back of the kennel: the sugarloaf. Pupcake has licked one side quite smooth. The point is cracked clean off, and there is custard in the crack. It wants dusting for fingerprints.",B.az,B.af,"kennel",B.j,B.c,!1,null)
