B.Kd=new A.N("prints","Prints on the Iron","",0,"Two sets of prints came up under the powder. Penny Cotta's are old and faint, all along the wooden handle. Over them, on the sole plate itself, is one sharp thumb. It is Graham Cracker's.",B.bp,B.b1,null,B.j,B.c,!1,"churlock")
