B.LW=new A.N("planner","Appointment Book","study",0,"Mrs. Senclair's appointment book, kept under lock. Tomorrow's page: \u201c10 AM. Mr. Churlock, of Biscuit Street. Tell him about J. before J. can talk me out of it again.\u201d",B.cL,B.H,"desk",B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.I0=new A.h(1,1,0.6705882352941176,0.5686274509803921,B.d)
B.LR=new A.N("tornsheet","Torn Strip of Paper","study",0,"Folded very small behind the lining of the drawer: a strip torn from the right-hand edge of a police form. The printing matches the sergeant's list of suspects exactly, and so does the tear. There is a sixth name on it. \u201cDr. Long John Watsonut, physician. Born Donut County. Guest of the deceased. Slept in the house last night.\u201d",B.m_,B.I0,"desk",B.j,B.c,!0,null)
B.Sf=s([B.cH,B.cn,B.eJ,B.iP,B.LW,B.LR],t.F)
B.N1=new A.a1(58240,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.KI=new A.N("chainlink","Gold Chain Link","cellar",1,"Lying in the spilled custard beside the outline: a single link of very fine gold chain, pulled open. The kind of chain a gentleman hangs an eyeglass on.",B.N1,B.ar,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.LG=new A.N("drizzle","Dark Smear","cellar",2,"A dark brown smear on the flagstones beside the outline, on top of the custard. It is not powder. It is set, and glossy, and it cracks like icing.",B.bJ,B.ev,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.Up=s([B.KI,B.LG],t.F)
B.KO=new A.N("syringesack","Piping Syringe","pantry",3,"Pushed deep into a flour sack: a big brass piping syringe from the kitchen, the plunger drawn right back, and full to the top with vanilla custard. It wants dusting for fingerprints.",B.az,B.af,"sacks",B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.Lj=new A.N("syringedirt","Piping Syringe","backyard",0,"Buried in the loose earth: a big brass piping syringe from the kitchen, the plunger drawn right back, and full to the top with vanilla custard. It wants dusting for fingerprints.",B.az,B.af,"dirt",B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.Rs=s([B.KO,B.Lj],t.F)
B.Ky=new A.N("wwnote","Note Signed J. W.","mbedroom",2,"Slipped under her pillow, much folded and unfolded: \u201c\xc9claire. You promised you would never tell him. Thirty years ago is thirty years ago. Meet me in the cellar at eleven and name your price. J. W.\u201d",B.b9,B.H,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.Ls=new A.N("wwbill","Receipted Account","cellar",0,"Locked in the strongbox, an account receipted every year for thirty years: \u201cFor professional discretion. Paid with thanks. J. W.\u201d Across this year's, in Mrs. Senclair's hand: \u201cNo more. He must be told.\u201d",B.qu,B.H,"strongbox",B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.Uh=s([B.Ky,B.Ls],t.F)
B.KH=new A.N("guestcot","Camp Bed","storage",4,"A camp bed made up among the trunks, and slept in. There is a round dent in the pillow where something like a hat was set down, and under the bed a black leather bag, empty, stamped J. W.",B.lZ,B.bm,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.KE=new A.N("sixthplace","Supper Table","dining",2,"Last night's supper has not been cleared. There are six places laid, not five. Graham's card at the sixth reads only: \u201cJ. W. No walnuts.\u201d",B.qw,B.l1,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.Uq=s([B.KH,B.KE],t.F)
B.U9=s([B.dL,B.Up,B.Rs,B.Uh,B.Uq],t.Rt)
B.Vm=s([B.cw,B.cm,B.cD,B.cr,B.cG,B.cC,B.cB,B.cI,B.cx,B.cp,B.cu,B.dD,B.dE,B.cl,B.cz,B.cF,B.cJ,B.co,B.cs,B.cv,B.cy,B.dF,B.cE,B.dC,B.cq,B.eK,B.iO,B.cA,B.ck,B.ct,B.dB],t.F)
B.Za={syringesack:0,syringedirt:1}
B.a7a=new A.bY(B.Za,2,t.Q)
B.LM=new A.N("prints","Prints on the Syringe","",0,"Two sets of prints came up under the powder. One is Penny Cotta's, on the barrel. The other is a whole hand around the plunger, sharp and fresh. I have held it against all five cards on the police chart, twice. It matches none of them.",B.bp,B.b1,null,B.j,B.c,!1,"churlock")
B.YP={chart:0,cellarbook:1,ovenlog:2,extension:3,watch:4,clock:5,phone:6,souffle:7,scoresheet:8,boots:9,planner:10,tornsheet:11,chainlink:12,drizzle:13,syringesack:14,syringedirt:15,wwnote:16,wwbill:17,guestcot:18,sixthplace:19,prints:20}
B.XD=new A.aW(B.YP,["Splendid. Now all we want is the weapon.",u.h,u.p,u.X,u.Q,u.Q,u.B,u.N,"No gaps at all, and each man watching the other. I should say that settles the pair of them.","Locked out until midnight, by the look of it. Though a latch only stops those who knock, Churlock. Who would know the other ways into a house better than the man who tends the outside of it?","J.? I should think of the calendar before I thought of a person, old chap. June. July. She kept a busy diary.","Churlock. Old friend. I can explain that. ...No. No, I don't suppose I can.","A gentleman's eyeglass chain. Now, who in this house wears an eyeglass, Churlock? I should ask him to show you his.","Brown, and on top of the custard. Who under this roof leaves brown on whatever she touches? Compare it with the wine rack, old chap.","It came out of the kitchen, and it never got far from it. I should ask who is at home in both of those rooms.","Out of the kitchen, and under the earth. I should ask who is at home with a mixing bowl, and who with a spade.",u.C,u.C,"Old houses are full of beds that nobody sleeps in. I shouldn't read a great deal into a dent in a pillow, old chap.","A careful butler lays one more than he needs. Ask him, by all means. But I doubt there is much in it.","Powder plays tricks on brass, Churlock. A smudge and a sleeve can look very like a hand. I should trust the chart over my own eyes."],t.l)
B.Vj=s(["Before you name anyone, Churlock: five alibis cannot all be sound. I should begin with the one that nobody watched. Two hours in a greenhouse is a long while to be alone.","Look at what was left beside the body, old chap, and ask yourself who in this house it most resembles. I should start with the obvious owner.","Is the list complete? Naturally it is. Five names, as the sergeant gave it to me. Paper frays at the edges, old chap. I shouldn't dwell on that.","The weapon came out of the kitchen, Churlock. In my experience a thing finds its way back to whoever owns it. Let us finish this, and go home."],t.s)
B.YI={boots:0,planner:1,chainlink:2,drizzle:3,syringesack:4,syringedirt:5,wwnote:6,wwbill:7,guestcot:8,sixthplace:9,prints:10,"accuse:0":11,"accuse:1":12,"accuse:2":13,"accuse:3":14}
B.a7c=new A.bY(B.YI,15,t.Q)
B.YZ={glaze:0}
B.XK=new A.aW(B.YZ,["Morning, Detective. Watch your step around the outline. ...Long John? Long John Watsonut! It's Glaze, from the old street. Well, hello! Twenty years. I never knew you had left Donut County."],t.l)
B.YF={planner:0,tornsheet:1,chainlink:2,drizzle:3,syringesack:4,syringedirt:5,wwnote:6,wwbill:7,guestcot:8,sixthplace:9,prints:10,"accuse:2":11,"accuse:3":12}
B.a75=new A.bY(B.YF,13,t.Q)
B.ahD=new A.l("what","What happened to her?","Victim is Mrs. \xc9claire Senclair, founder of Senclair Confections. One small hole, Detective, and every drop of custard drawn out of her through it, neat as you like. Whoever did this knew exactly where a pastry keeps her filling.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.ahI=new A.l("weapon","What was the weapon?","Something with a needle or a nozzle, and a plunger to pull. There'll be a pint of custard in it, wherever it is.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.ahT=new A.l("home","Who was in the house?","Five residents on your list, all home, every door latched from the inside. Funny thing, though. I'd have sworn I filled that form right across to the margin. I gave it to your partner at the door to pass to you.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.rt=s(["tornsheet"],t.s)
B.afu=new A.l("list","Is this strip torn from your list?","That's it! That's the end of my form. Six names I took down, Detective, not five: the five who live here, and the doctor who was stopping the night. I handed all six to your partner.",B.rt,B.c,null)
B.QK=s([B.ahD,B.ahI,B.ahT,B.afu,B.cS],t.q)
B.agr=new A.l("nomatch","There is a print on the weapon that is not on your chart.","Then it isn't one of the five, Detective. We printed everybody on the Sarge's list. If somebody was in this house last night and isn't on that list, I'd like to know why not.",B.aO,B.c,null)
B.RT=s([B.hH,B.hC,B.hE,B.hB,B.agr],t.q)
B.afe=new A.l("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Strict, but fair. Her heart had been troubling her this week, and her temper with it. She'd something on her mind she wouldn't tell me.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.aeT=new A.l("suspect","Who do you suspect?","I've gone round and round it, Detective, and I can't make it any of us. Everybody was somewhere. It's as if there was one more in the house than there was.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.Vb=s(["syringesack","syringedirt"],t.s)
B.aeV=new A.l("syringe","This is your piping syringe.","My big one, for \xe9clairs! It was asked for at twenty to eleven, at my kitchen door. To give Madam her drops, he said. I never looked round from the oven. I thought nothing of it. He's been coming here for years.",B.Vb,B.c,null)
B.Qe=s(["penny/syringe"],t.s)
B.aeD=new A.l("doctor","Who asked you for it?","Why, the doctor. Madam's doctor. He always stops the night when her heart's bad. I couldn't tell you his name, we only ever say \u201cthe doctor\u201d. A round gentleman. Very dark. Smells of chocolate.",B.c,B.Qe,null)
B.S1=s([B.db,B.afe,B.aeT,B.aeV,B.aeD,B.e3,B.d2,B.ea,B.da,B.d9,B.dd,B.d4,B.cY,B.dh,B.dc],t.q)
B.ahn=new A.l("suspect","Who do you suspect?","It is not a butler's place to speculate, sir. Though on this occasion I confess I cannot make the arithmetic come out.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.V6=s(["sixthplace","guestcot"],t.s)
B.ahl=new A.l("sixth","Who was the sixth at supper?","Madam's physician, sir. He dines and stays whenever her heart is troublesome. I know him only by the initials on his bag. He comes in a dressing gown and slippers by the garden door, and is gone before I am up.",B.V6,B.c,null)
B.VB=s(["wwnote","wwbill"],t.s)
B.ahU=new A.l("initials","Do the initials J. W. mean anything to you?","Not to me, sir. But Madam said them aloud on Tuesday, to herself, at her desk. She had taken to mumbling. \u201cJ. W. goes behind the lining, where he will never think to look.\u201d She had a little compartment made in that drawer years ago, sir, in the corner. I was not supposed to know of it.",B.VB,B.c,null)
B.af4=new A.l("name","Your doctor is named on this strip.","Is it indeed, sir. I had only the initials. I should not have known the gentleman in a bowler hat and a moustache. Last night he wore neither. ...Sir, I do not wish to alarm you, but he is standing directly behind you.",B.rt,B.c,null)
B.RI=s([B.nL,B.e5,B.ahn,B.ahl,B.ahU,B.af4,B.d0,B.d3,B.d1,B.df,B.d7,B.cZ,B.dg,B.de],t.q)
B.aeo=new A.l("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Dashed if I know, sir. I have suspected each of them in turn since breakfast and each of them has an answer.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.SB=s(["chainlink"],t.s)
B.afM=new A.l("chain","Is this link from your monocle chain?","Mine, sir? Count them. Forty links, and not one missing. Mine is a soldier's chain, thick as bootlace. That is a fine little thing. A professional man's chain. A lawyer's. A doctor's.",B.SB,B.c,null)
B.QJ=s([B.hG,B.hF,B.aeo,B.afM,B.fc,B.fb,B.jX,B.cU,B.cX,B.cV,B.e7],t.q)
B.afG=new A.l("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Darling, I've no idea, and it's maddening. Usually one simply knows.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.SP=s(["drizzle"],t.s)
B.agd=new A.l("smear","Is this smear your cocoa?","Darling, look at me. I am dusted. I am not iced. That is icing, chocolate icing, the kind that drips. Nobody who lives in this house is made of that.",B.SP,B.c,null)
B.aep=new A.l("footsteps","Did anyone pass you on the landing?","Somebody came down from the storage nook just as I picked up the telephone, darling. In slippers. I took it for Graham and didn't turn round. But Graham was at chess, wasn't he?",B.eO,B.c,null)
